  "contract": [
    "recover_signed_intent keeps the Supervisor reachable while retaining the per-Agent RecoveryRequired fence.",
    "Current negative control writes a valid, exact-digest legacy Abort directive, recovers again, and requires the Agent to remain inactive and RecoveryRequired.",
    "SignedIntentRecoveryDirective validates schema and self-computed digest only. Its serialized fields contain no signer identity, signature, authority epoch, expiry, or authenticated lifecycle/release-state CAS.",
    "resolve_production_recovery requires ProductionRecoveryDecision and invokes verify_recovery after durable transaction, current release and executable binding checks. verify_recovery checks exact grant/intent/transaction/release/artifact bindings, lifecycle generation, authority epoch, signer identity/epoch, validity window and cryptographic signature."
  ],
